(This activity aims to provide students with relevant knowledge and practical insights on) Tj
T* (cybersecurity and ethical hacking through an expert-led seminar. The session will be) Tj
T* (divided into two learning tracks: Cybersecurity Awareness for Senior High School) Tj
T* (students and Ethical Hacking Fundamentals for BSIT students. The resource speaker from) Tj
T* (the Ormoc City Cyber Response Team \(OCCRT\) will discuss current cyber threats, online) Tj
T* (safety practices, digital responsibility, and the role of ethical hackers in protecting) Tj
T* (information systems.) Tj
